                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tokenize/extract-card",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "tokenize",
                    "extract-card"
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Extract the card details from a photo of a physical card and tokenize them.\n\nThis allows a customer to take a photo of their credit/debit card and have\nthe card details auto-populated during checkout instead of typing them in\nmanually. The card is extracted and stored as a token in Coinflow's\nPCI-compliant vault, and the resulting token is returned so it can be used\nin the cards endpoint.\n\nIn order to gain access to this endpoint your company must have PCI-DSS\ncertification, and provide that to your Coinflow Integrations Representative."
              },
